  VALUES (
    '28153f59-8b3a-40b1-8e7c-3f22f4604ecb',
    'Clinic Check Hub',
    'venn_diagram'::dm_question_type,
    'The diagram shows 200 clinic patients categorised by which of five health checks they have completed. Each letter marks a different region.

Which letter represents a patient who is registered and has completed the blood-pressure check but no other check?',
    NULL,
    '{"diagramLayout":"auto","sets":[{"id":"set1","label":"Registered","shape":"horizontal_strip"},{"id":"set2","label":"Blood pressure","shape":"oval"},{"id":"set3","label":"Weight","shape":"triangle"},{"id":"set4","label":"Vision","shape":"pentagon"},{"id":"set5","label":"Hearing","shape":"diamond"}],"regions":{"set1_only":"P","set1_set2":"Q","set1_set3":"R","set1_set4":"S","set1_set5":"T","outside":"V"}}'::jsonb,
    'B',
    'The question asks for a patient inside the registered and blood-pressure regions and outside every other check. Letter P is registered only — no blood-pressure check. Letter R is registered and weight, not blood pressure. Letter T is registered and hearing, not blood pressure. Letter Q is registered and blood pressure and outside every other check — that matches. Answer: Letter Q.',
    40,
    'normal',
