  VALUES (
    '88313aff-c3fd-41fa-b0a1-61839b4dea35',
    'Garment Features',
    'venn_diagram'::dm_question_type,
    'The diagram shows 260 garments reviewed for a buyer''s guide, tagged as waterproof, insulated, machine-washable, recycled, or second-hand. Each letter marks a different region.

Which letter represents a garment that is both insulated and machine-washable, but not waterproof?',
    NULL,
    '{"diagramLayout":"auto","sets":[{"id":"set1","label":"Certified outdoor range","shape":"rectangle"},{"id":"set2","label":"Waterproof","shape":"hexagon"},{"id":"set3","label":"Insulated","shape":"circle"},{"id":"set4","label":"Machine-washable","shape":"octagon"},{"id":"set5","label":"Recycled","shape":"pentagon"},{"id":"set6","label":"Second-hand","shape":"diamond"}],"regions":{"set1_only":"A","set1_set2":"B","set1_set3":"C","set1_set4":"D","set1_set2_set3":"E","set1_set3_set4":"F","set5_only":"G","set6_only":"H","outside":"I"}}'::jsonb,
    'B',
    'The question needs Insulated AND Machine-washable inside the Certified outdoor range, with Waterproof excluded. Letter D is the range with Machine-washable only — missing Insulated. Letter E is the range with Waterproof and Insulated — Waterproof is excluded. Letter C is the range with Insulated only — missing Machine-washable. Letter F is the region inside the range where Insulated overlaps Machine-washable, outside Waterproof — correct.',
    68,
    'hard',
    '{"canvas":{"width":300,"height":322},"shapes":[{"id":"set1","label":"Certified outdoor range","kind":"rect","x":32.65249832471258,"y":189.03573480259197,"width":231.46756665905582,"height":107.46708452027593},{"id":"set2","label":"Waterproof","kind":"polygon","points":[[106.95280150548562,206.12448996497565],[137.3603279647852,226.74668340048242],[134.70474779752942,263.3914704982367],[101.6416411709741,279.41406416048426],[71.23411471167452,258.79187072497746],[73.8896948789303,222.1470836272232]]},{"id":"set3","label":"Insulated","kind":"circle","cx":148.3862816542405,"cy":242.76927706272994,"r":36.74088359667553},{"id":"set4","label":"Machine-washable","kind":"polygon","points":[[192.5427997363133,206.02845539371634],[218.50272596260254,216.83729275803103],[229.21616363926472,242.83673482879212],[218.40732627495004,268.79666105508136],[192.40788420418895,279.51009873174354],[166.4479579778997,268.70126136742886],[155.73452030123752,242.70181929666776],[166.5433576655522,216.74189307037852]]},{"id":"set5","label":"Recycled","kind":"polygon","points":[[75.4413082810987,25.497180677132064],[139.06396124496277,71.53106671641136],[114.94361494997128,146.26505850493638],[36.413768155384915,146.41931950592107],[12.000000000000009,71.78066625914319]]},{"id":"set6","label":"Second-hand","kind":"polygon","points":[[221.66802417811388,25.498691114906237],[288.00000000000006,92.76664972862523],[220.73204138628105,159.09862555051137],[154.40006556439488,91.8306669367924]]}],"labels":[{"region":"set1_only","text":"A","x":241.28976788165454,"y":212.124366242495,"fontSize":16},{"region":"set1_set2","text":"B","x":92.00098861312098,"y":248.6663384426961,"fontSize":16},{"region":"set1_set3","text":"C","x":149.1164048902359,"y":264.9916335286253,"fontSize":16},{"region":"set1_set4","text":"D","x":206.12655293393152,"y":243.46500867323712,"fontSize":16},{"region":"set1_set2_set3","text":"E","x":124.10106723137476,"y":240.39150296025272,"fontSize":20},{"region":"set1_set3_set4","text":"F","x":171.11973289208487,"y":242.80861415795346,"fontSize":23},{"region":"set5_only","text":"G","x":75.57253052628354,"y":92.29865833270884,"fontSize":16},{"region":"set6_only","text":"H","x":221.20003278219747,"y":92.29865833270881,"fontSize":16},{"region":"outside","text":"I","x":284.15,"y":19,"fontSize":14}],"ambiguity":{"hasDuplicates":false,"allIdentical":false}}'::jsonb
