Who sits in seat 4?',
    NULL,
    NULL,
    'C',
    'Alice is in seat 2, so Dan is in seat 5 (opposite). Ben is immediately clockwise of Alice = seat 3. Carla is immediately clockwise of Dan = seat 6. Seats 1 and 4 remain for Evie and Finn. Finn cannot sit next to Ben (seat 3); the seats next to seat 3 are 2 (Alice) and 4. So Finn cannot take seat 4 — Finn is in seat 1 and Evie is in seat 4.',
    190,
    'normal',
    NULL
  ) RETURNING id INTO v_id;

