  VALUES (
    'de83c31c-7241-4aba-a822-42295ddb5e1a',
    'Hobby Club Membership',
    'venn_diagram'::dm_question_type,
    'The diagram shows members of a hobby club categorised by five activities: chess, baking, hiking, pottery, and drama. Each letter marks a different region.

Which letter represents a member who takes part in baking and hiking but neither chess, pottery, nor drama?',
    NULL,
    '{"diagramLayout":"auto","sets":[{"id":"set1","label":"Chess","shape":"diamond"},{"id":"set2","label":"Baking","shape":"pentagon"},{"id":"set3","label":"Hiking","shape":"hexagon"},{"id":"set4","label":"Pottery","shape":"rectangle"},{"id":"set5","label":"Drama","shape":"star"}],"regions":{"set1_only":"P","set1_set2":"Q","set2_set3":"R","set3_set4":"S","set4_set5":"T","outside":"V"}}'::jsonb,
    'C',
    'Consecutive activities overlap in the diagram; non-consecutive activities do not, because no one takes a later activity without taking every earlier one. The question asks for the region inside baking and hiking but outside chess, pottery, and drama. Letter P sits inside chess only. Letter Q sits inside chess and baking — includes chess, which is excluded. Letter S sits inside hiking and pottery — includes pottery, which is excluded. Letter R sits inside baking and hiking, outside chess, pottery, and drama — that is the region we want. Answer: Letter R.',
    198,
    'normal',
    '{"canvas":{"width":340,"height":157},"shapes":[{"id":"set1","label":"Chess","kind":"polygon","points":[[62.89778066836521,29.900332921369653],[114.05852353836667,80.7981135897349],[63.160742870001435,131.95885645973635],[11.999999999999972,81.06107579137111]]},{"id":"set2","label":"Baking","kind":"polygon","points":[[114.74535164522828,31.509688975551725],[162.12665501009985,61.89718339669999],[147.8680583823644,116.3497329050273],[91.67445766967765,119.6157648541117],[71.20349910673242,67.18173409866161]]},{"id":"set3","label":"Hiking","kind":"polygon","points":[[171.99141355932548,25.041143540263654],[215.4912170077038,50.12512864292704],[215.51775040483605,100.33905604018427],[172.04448035359,125.46899833477812],[128.54467690521167,100.38501323211474],[128.51814350807942,50.17108583485749]]},{"id":"set4","label":"Pottery","kind":"polygon","points":[[174.88932752269739,40.01383247446185],[274.26562926787506,34.85433606163858],[278.13525157749245,109.38656237052183],[178.75894983231484,114.5460587833451]]},{"id":"set5","label":"Drama","kind":"polygon","points":[[282.1641605122735,32.87508321178671],[295.88607737158264,62.415583580633324],[328,67.85875708068342],[304.1456201345157,90.03759216210274],[308.89260235619105,122.26178065650424],[280.4278679594614,106.42855419885332],[251.24774168803103,120.90102444822668],[257.5099482155982,88.93671726440498],[234.72865616216504,65.65700728528786],[267.0636470375027,61.735205476494556]]}],"labels":[{"region":"set1_only","text":"P","x":48.71843225844208,"y":80.71864316705356,"fontSize":16},{"region":"set1_set2","text":"Q","x":92.63101132254954,"y":80.98686340435157,"fontSize":16},{"region":"set2_set3","text":"R","x":144.00956677854197,"y":68.88035925951313,"fontSize":16},{"region":"set3_set4","text":"S","x":195.83835807130012,"y":63.67307805164363,"fontSize":16},{"region":"set4_set5","text":"T","x":262.815355447944,"y":75.55023403367068,"fontSize":22},{"region":"outside","text":"V","x":324.15,"y":19,"fontSize":14}],"a