  VALUES (
    '19191294-3c9c-4f46-a54a-24d4792af39d',
    'Faculty Module Catalogue',
    'venn_diagram'::dm_question_type,
    'The diagram shows 220 modules catalogued at a university, grouped by a Faculty tag and three department tags (Humanities, Sciences, Engineering). Each letter marks a different region.

Which letter represents a module tagged to Faculty and to Humanities, but to no other department?',
    NULL,
    '{"diagramLayout":"auto","sets":[{"id":"set1","label":"Faculty","shape":"circle"},{"id":"set2","label":"Humanities","shape":"hexagon"},{"id":"set3","label":"Sciences","shape":"pentagon"},{"id":"set4","label":"Engineering","shape":"trapezoid"}],"regions":{"set1_only":"P","set2_only":"Q","set3_only":"R","set4_only":"S","set1_set2":"T","set1_set3":"U","set1_set4":"V","outside":"W"}}'::jsonb,
    'C',
    'The question wants a module inside the Faculty tag and inside Humanities, but outside Sciences and Engineering. Letter P is inside the Faculty tag only, with no department. Letter Q is Humanities only, with no Faculty tag. Letter U is Faculty and Sciences — wrong department. Letter T is the region where the Faculty tag overlaps Humanities alone.',
    205,
    'normal',
    '{"canvas":{"width":300,"height":308},"shapes":[{"id":"set1","label":"Faculty","kind":"circle","cx":152.86333749513133,"cy":169.59819866002812,"r":71.19736242129056},{"id":"set2","label":"Humanities","kind":"polygon","points":[[179.9624486815721,25.39551261782553],[239.60077083998618,64.28426350902562],[235.7412857259692,135.37694098289262],[172.2434784535382,167.58086756555957],[112.60515629512413,128.69211667435948],[116.4646414091411,57.59943920049245]]},{"id":"set3","label":"Sciences","kind":"polygon","points":[[220.725482151952,143.2360613880821],[287.99999999999994,193.02977564715917],[261.4323328867933,272.3987481462647],[177.73809376099095,271.6577565437906],[152.57987643189034,191.83082604897777]]},{"id":"set4","label":"Engineering","kind":"polygon","points":[[48.90566223415757,136.5071762400176],[127.17664797329654,139.19431867749802],[154.31088316207078,282.6044873821745],[11.999999999999979,277.71877385948284]]}],"labels":[{"region":"set1_only","text":"P","x":150.47790440706677,"y":173.1059663899883,"fontSize":16},{"region":"set2_only","text":"Q","x":178.81391405844823,"y":66.55966152184574,"fontSize":16},{"region":"set3_only","text":"R","x":235.9810626628037,"y":236.6818447494708,"fontSize":16},{"region":"set4_only","text":"S","x":64.53272835474878,"y":238.51517256908005,"fontSize":16},{"region":"set1_set2","text":"T","x":173.4079182034638,"y":133.26108639951894,"fontSize":16},{"region":"set1_set3","text":"U","x":183.57351473963644,"y":202.05942732801344,"fontSize":16},{"region":"set1_set4","text":"V","x":108.94154489031946,"y":181.33229832844023,"fontSize":16},{"region":"outside","text":"W","x":15.850000000000001,"y":19,"fontSize":14}],"ambiguity":{"hasDuplicates":false,"allIdentical":false}}'::jsonb
