    'Hospital Nursing Grades',
    'venn_diagram'::dm_question_type,
    'A hospital employs 180 staff. 90 of the staff are doctors. All consultants are doctors. All surgeons-in-training are consultants. There are 32 consultants, 12 of whom are surgeons-in-training.

