    '{"diagramLayout":"auto","sets":[{"id":"set1","label":"Booked online","shape":"circle"},{"id":"set2","label":"General Practice team","shape":"pentagon"},{"id":"set3","label":"Mental Health team","shape":"hexagon"},{"id":"set4","label":"Sexual Health team","shape":"diamond"},{"id":"set5","label":"Physiotherapy team","shape":"star"}],"regions":{"set1_only":"A","set2_only":"B","set3_only":"C","set4_only":"D","set5_only":"E","set1_set2":"F","set1_set3":"G","set1_set4":"H","set1_set5":"I","outside":"J"}}'::jsonb,
    'C',
    'The question wants booked online AND Mental Health. Letter A sits inside booked online only — no Mental Health team. Letter B is General Practice only — not booked online, wrong team. Letter F is the overlap between booked online and General Practice — wrong team. Letter G is the lens where booked online overlaps Mental Health — that is the region. Answer: Letter G.',
