How many tickets did Ben sell?',
    NULL,
    NULL,
    'B',
    'Let Ben''s total be x. Then Amy = 2x, Dan = 2x, Carla = x + 20, Enid = x + 10. Sum: x + 2x + 2x + (x+20) + (x+10) = 7x + 30 = 240, so 7x = 210 and x = 30. Ben sold 30.',
    282,
    'hard',
    NULL
  ) RETURNING id INTO v_id;

