Which of the following pairings of volunteers with charities is consistent with all the constraints?',
    NULL,
    NULL,
    'A',
    'Ravi = Move and Quinn = Hope are fixed. That leaves Priya and Sam to pair with Listen and Shelter. Priya ≠ Listen, so Priya = Shelter and Sam = Listen. Final: Priya-Shelter, Quinn-Hope, Ravi-Move, Sam-Listen — option A.',
    291,
    'normal',
    NULL
  ) RETURNING id INTO v_id;

